00:16:14.760 --> 00:16:17.727
Give me a chance. We would make a good team.

242
00:16:18.920 --> 00:16:23.319
Okay. look. this isn't a joke. okay?

243
00:16:23.520 --> 00:16:26.998
Hanging out with a homicidal freak
might not be the brightest move.

244
00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:30.678
Has it occurred to you that l'm
capable of making that decision?

245
00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.449
''Homicidal freak.'' God. you are so emo.

246
00:16:33.640 --> 00:16:37.402
- Excuse me?
- Learn to enjoy your shit already.

247
00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.760
You can fricking control people by touch...

248
00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:44.597
and not in a creepy hand- job way.
That is awesome.

249
00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.523
Fine.

250
00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:51.959
Fine. let's say l take you with me.
What's in it for you?

251
00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:54.047
Out here? Survival.

252
00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:56.513
Mom said. ''Find the toughest
kid on the playground

253
00:16:56.640 --> 00:16:58.402
and make friends with them.''

254
00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:01.726
You are definitely the toughest
kid on this playground.

255
00:17:01.920 --> 00:17:04.602
- lt would kick ass to be your friend.
- l don't know.

256
00:17:04.800 --> 00:17:07.164
Come on. Every superhero needs a partner.

257
00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:09.008
Let me be your Robin.

258
00:17:09.200 --> 00:17:10.439
l'll think about it.

259
00:17:14.160 --> 00:17:16.558
- Take them.
- Here we go.

260
00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:21.480
Kenzi. what's wrong?

261
00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:35.164
- Where are we taking them?
- To The Ash.

262
00:17:35.360 --> 00:17:39.327
- He insists on an audience.
- Sucks to be her.

263
00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:02.242
Guys. seriously. where's my friend. huh?

264
00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:03.679
Where's my friend?

265
00:18:03.880 --> 00:18:06.278
- Just take off the hood.
- Squirmish one. huh?

266
00:18:06.480 --> 00:18:09.401
Oh. you guys have no idea what
you are dealing with here.

267
00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:11.839
Okay. Okay. just take off the hood!

268
00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.563
Calm down.

269
00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:16.408
l'm not saying anything without my lawyer.

270
00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:19.807
- Lawyer?
- l know my rights. assholes.

271
00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.478
- ls she serious?
- What is this place. huh?

272
00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:26.769
l don't understand your obstinacy.

273
00:18:26.960 --> 00:18:29.358
You know the rules.

274
00:18:32.520 --> 00:18:33.759
Just name your clan.

275
00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:38.597
Buddy. for the last time.
l don't have a clan. okay?

276
00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:41.846
Or bagpipes. or haggis.
l'm not fricking Scottish.

277
00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:45.245
l mean. what the hell kind of
cops are you people. anyway?

278
00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.679
- What is this place?
- l'm starting to think she's not faking.

279
00:18:48.880 --> 00:18:51.562
Faking it? Oh. that's great.

280
00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:57.159
So do you truly not know what you are?

281
00:18:57.720 --> 00:18:59.686
What am l?

282
00:19:04.320 --> 00:19:06.286
Forget about me. What the hell are you?

283
00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:10.924
l'm sorry. lt's The Morrigan.
She insists on seeing her.

284
00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:20.524
- You were not invited.
- l know. And l'm hurt.

285
00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:24.088
Cut the shit. Word has it
that somebody's kill...

286
00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:27.406
was improperly dumped in
your territory last night.

287
00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.646
And not by a local.

288
00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.718
lt'd be nice to know if we
had a new player in town.

289
00:19:32.920 --> 00:19:34.807
We're handling it.

290
00:19:35.000 --> 00:19:36.728
l don't speak to the help.

291
00:19:36.920 --> 00:19:40.682
Hi. Yeah. hello? Could somebody tell
me what the hell is going on here?

292
00:19:40.880 --> 00:19:43.006
Lauren. take her to the lab.

293
00:19:44.040 --> 00:19:45.245
Grab her.

294
00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:50.960
Enough.

295
00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.881
Lauren needs to examine the girl.

296
00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:02.288
Please. come with me.

297
00:20:08.920 --> 00:20:11.682
You and l need to talk.

298
00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:34.005
Because l'm your cousin.
and l'm in trouble. you dick.

299
00:20:34.200 --> 00:20:37.007
Yeah. l know your frigging
connections. okay?

300
00:20:37.200 --> 00:20:39.678
You want these wallets?
Trace that plate for me.

301
00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:42.642
Or l'm telling your mom you're being mean.

302
00:20:43.880 --> 00:20:45.801
Asshole.

303
00:20:53.960 --> 00:20:56.245
So. what are you checking me for?

304
00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.009
Brands.

305
00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.882
Ritual scarring.

306
00:21:00.600 --> 00:21:04.124
The different clans mark
themselves in different ways.

307
00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:07.644
My God. you're beautiful.

308
00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:12.127
l meant that professionally.

309
00:21:14.800 --> 00:21:16.928
lt's cool. l....

310
00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:21.044
l kind of have that effect on people.

311
00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:24.764
Well. that would fit my hypothesis on you.

312
00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:30.004
Would you mind if l asked you some
incredibly personal questions?

313
00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:33.485
Well. all questions feel kind of
personal when you're commando.

314
00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:36.999
Right. Sorry.

315
00:21:37.560 --> 00:21:39.049
Please.

316
00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:46.125
l'll.... l'll answer
yours if you answer mine.

317
00:21:47.480 --> 00:21:50.162
What the hell were those
freaks that l just met?

318
00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:54.327
They're Fae. an evolutionary
branch that predates on humans.

319
00:21:54.520 --> 00:21:57.202
- So am l Fae?
- Yes.

320
00:21:57.400 --> 00:22:01.003
Well. that's your genus. not your species.

321
00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:03.846
And for those of us who flunked biology?

322
00:22:04.040 --> 00:22:05.722
l meant- -

323
00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:09.921
Fae is a general classification.
There are many different types.

324
00:22:10.600 --> 00:22:12.646
So. what type are you?

325
00:22:13.080 --> 00:22:17.161
The ''insatiably curious
human doctor'' type.

326
00:22:18.280 --> 00:22:21.008
- l'm in it for the science.
- Oh. kinky.

327
00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:25.086
Now for the million-
dollar question.

328
00:22:27.560 --> 00:22:30.208
What kind of Fae am l?

329
00:22:30.400 --> 00:22:32.400
The girl doesn't even know she's Fae.

330
00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:36.521
- She's as ignorant as a human.
- And so are you if you believe her.

331
00:22:37.280 --> 00:22:39.724
Oh. come on. l mean. listen to yourself.

332
00:22:39.920 --> 00:22:43.921
You're not seriously suggesting that
she's been hidden from us since birth?

333
00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:47.200
We need to be united in
how we deal with this.

334
00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:48.844
Little problem.

335
00:22:49.040 --> 00:22:52.404
- l'm not a team player.
- lf word gets out we've had a free Fae...

336
00:22:52.600 --> 00:22:55.919
under our noses. we'll be the
laughingstock of the counties.

337
00:22:56.120 --> 00:22:57.564
Let's just kill the bitch.

338
00:22:57.760 --> 00:23:00.999
- lt would be wiser to wait.
- Tell me...

339
00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:05.724
was your neutering
ceremonial or a birth defect?

340
00:23:06.800 --> 00:23:09.164
Her freedom is dangerous to us both.

341
00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:12.042
She cannot be allowed to
exist in between our sides.

342
00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:15.639
Which is why we need to make
her choose between us...

343
00:23:15.840 --> 00:23:17.045
the old way.

344
00:23:19.360 --> 00:23:21.406
l examined your kill
from last night.

345
00:23:21.600 --> 00:23:24.362
Based on your feeding signature. you're- -

346
00:23:24.560 --> 00:23:25.844
Just say it.

347
00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:29.640
- You're a Succubus.
- A Succubus?

348
00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:35.966
Can you fix it?

349
00:23:37.320 --> 00:23:39.127
Well. there's nothing to fix.

350
00:23:39.320 --> 00:23:41.968
You're a perfect biological
specimen of your kind.

351
00:23:42.160 --> 00:23:45.843
Who has a habit of waking
up next to dead lovers.

352
00:23:46.040 --> 00:23:48.882
lf that's not sick.
then l would like a second opinion.

353
00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:52.645
We can help you learn to
control it. if you like.

354
00:23:52.840 --> 00:23:54.806
- That's possible?
- Definitely.

355
00:23:55.000 --> 00:23:58.160
lf you'd been born into a clan.
you would've been taught how.

356
00:23:58.360 --> 00:24:02.156
You'd still have to feed.
but you wouldn't always have to kill.

357
00:24:03.440 --> 00:24:06.839
You deserve a normal life.
and we can offer that to you.

358
00:24:07.040 --> 00:24:10.007
- What's the catch?
- The Fae are divided.

359
00:24:10.200 --> 00:24:13.917
The Light and the Dark. l presume
they'd want you to join one of them...

360
00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:17.200
before they'd allow me
to offer you much help.

361
00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:25.409
l can offer you things.

362
00:24:27.440 --> 00:24:28.679
lf we get out of here.

363
00:24:30.240 --> 00:24:31.570
l know what you're doing.

364
00:24:32.200 --> 00:24:34.803
- Do you want me to stop?
- No.

365
00:24:40.840 --> 00:24:43.284
Didn't think it was gonna
be that easy. did you?

366
00:24:43.480 --> 00:24:46.401
- Girl can dream. can't she?
- Hands. please.

367
00:24:49.680 --> 00:24:51.044
Sorry. Had to try.

368
00:24:51.240 --> 00:24:54.207
No. Good. No. lt was very informative.

369
00:24:55.840 --> 00:24:58.204
- Where are you taking her?
- The glass factory.

370
00:24:58.400 --> 00:25:01.605
- Why?
- lt's neutral territory.

371
00:25:01.800 --> 00:25:05.437
- They're gonna give her the test.
- Without training? That's madness.

372
00:25:06.320 --> 00:25:08.286
lt's not our call.

373
00:25:18.280 --> 00:25:19.360
Did you get it?

374
00:25:19.560 --> 00:25:21.640
Wait. Hold on. hold on. hold on.

375
00:25:21.840 --> 00:25:24.841
Okay. Providence...

376
00:25:25.040 --> 00:25:28.120
Glass lnc. on Front.

377
00:25:28.320 --> 00:25:30.843
Thank you. Owe you one. Bye.

378
00:25:35.040 --> 00:25:36.688
Okay.

379
00:26:09.920 --> 00:26:12.318
Party at the glass factory.

380
00:26:12.520 --> 00:26:13.964
That's not weird.

381
00:26:32.560 --> 00:26:35.242
Pardon the Turkish- prison chic.

382
00:26:35.440 --> 00:26:37.520
lt's a little obvious for my taste.

383
00:26:38.320 --> 00:26:42.526
We can manage chairs. at least.
We're civilised folk.

384
00:26:43.200 --> 00:26:46.121
By the way. congrats on
your amnesia- girl routine.

385
00:26:46.320 --> 00:26:48.843
You've got everybody buying it.

386
00:26:49.040 --> 00:26:53.962
But between you and l. you know
more than you're telling. don't you?

387
00:26:55.000 --> 00:26:59.956
- Do you?
- Okay. Girl's gotta have her mystery.

388
00:27:00.160 --> 00:27:01.490
l can respect that.

389
00:27:01.680 --> 00:27:06.886
l'm sorry. Not to interrupt
your crazy. but who are you?

390
00:27:07.080 --> 00:27:11.717
Local government. Consider me the
welcome wagon for the Dark Fae.

391
00:27:11.920 --> 00:27:14.921
Do you know why you've
been brought here today?

392
00:27:15.120 --> 00:27:17.007
You're gonna be tested.

393
00:27:17.200 --> 00:27:18.246
Will there be math?

394
00:27:18.880 --> 00:27:22.358
Funny. She's funny.

395
00:27:23.120 --> 00:27:24.529
Listen here. Norma Fae...

396
00:27:24.720 --> 00:27:28.278
we have a millennia- old two- party system.
and it works just swell.

397
00:27:28.480 --> 00:27:30.401
Because membership is mandatory.

398
00:27:30.600 --> 00:27:33.282
- l must've lost my invitation.
- Which is a problem.

399
00:27:33.480 --> 00:27:36.162
You see. you running around
free and nonpartisan...

400
00:27:36.360 --> 00:27:38.440
gives all the little
lemmings ideas.

401
00:27:38.640 --> 00:27:42.039
l don't want any trouble. okay? Promise.

402
00:27:42.240 --> 00:27:43.888
Just let me go.

403
00:27:44.440 --> 00:27:47.441
Well. lucky for you.
if you survive your test today...

404
00:27:47.640 --> 00:27:50.845
you'll have the opportunity to
join a side. Problem solved.

405
00:27:51.040 --> 00:27:54.564
Join? Why the hell would l wanna do that?

406
00:27:54.760 --> 00:27:56.760
We take care of our own.

407
00:27:56.960 --> 00:28:00.245
We'll place you in a human
occupation that is to our advantage.

408
00:28:00.440 --> 00:28:03.918
Help with the disposal of your kills.
et cetera. et cetera.

409
00:28:05.240 --> 00:28:07.525
- And dental.
- Well. l'll keep that in mind.

410
00:28:07.720 --> 00:28:09.289
You should.

411
00:28:13.160 --> 00:28:16.559
l hear you've been alone for a long time.

412
00:28:17.320 --> 00:28:21.764
No friends or family.
Afraid you'd kill them. l'd imagine.

413
00:28:21.960 --> 00:28:23.369
Sounds lonely.

414
00:28:25.240 --> 00:28:29.002
You have the chance to be
a part of something now.

415
00:28:29.560 --> 00:28:31.720
Chance to have a new family.

416
00:28:32.160 --> 00:28:34.479
Or to have enemies.

417
00:28:35.560 --> 00:28:40.197
So be very careful how you
play the next few hours.

418
00:28:43.840 --> 00:28:46.727
Welcome to the top of the food chain. doll.

419
00:28:46.920 --> 00:28:49.239
Enjoy it while it lasts.

420
00:29:27.520 --> 00:29:29.600
So. what exactly am l in for here. huh?

421
00:29:29.800 --> 00:29:32.119
Big bad nasties? The Loch Ness Monster?

422
00:29:32.320 --> 00:29:33.525
Under Fae.

423
00:29:33.720 --> 00:29:35.766
- Under what. now?
- Under Fae.

424
00:29:35.960 --> 00:29:38.688
Those of our kind that don't
fit in the human world.

425
00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:40.642
Very old. Very dangerous.

426
00:29:40.840 --> 00:29:42.840
- You'll face two.
- What are my chances?

427
00:29:43.040 --> 00:29:44.165
l wouldn't bet on you.

428
00:29:44.360 --> 00:29:45.929
Have l spit in your coffee?

429
00:29:46.120 --> 00:29:48.439
- What is your deal?
- Kiss me.

430
00:29:48.640 --> 00:29:50.129
Are you bad at reading women.

431
00:29:50.320 --> 00:29:53.480
We don't have time. You need all
of the strength you can get.

432
00:29:53.680 --> 00:29:55.726
- Take some of mine.
- Won't l kill you?

433
00:29:55.920 --> 00:29:57.284
Just kiss me.

434
00:30:22.880 --> 00:30:25.244
Did you- - ? Did you feel that?
That was like- -

435
00:30:25.440 --> 00:30:29.123
That was like the Fourth
of July in my mouth.

436
00:30:30.080 --> 00:30:33.876
Hey. you stopped me.

437
00:30:34.360 --> 00:30:37.440
- No one's stopped me before.
- Fae are different than humans.

438
00:30:37.560 --> 00:30:39.242
Your powers won't work the same on us.

439
00:30:39.440 --> 00:30:41.918
Well. how am l supposed to beat these guys?

440
00:30:43.960 --> 00:30:46.529
You'll be faster.
You'll be smarter.

441
00:30:46.720 --> 00:30:50.278
They're gonna underestimate you.
Use that to your advantage.

442
00:30:50.480 --> 00:30:52.401
l misjudged you.

443
00:30:52.600 --> 00:30:54.680
You got any other advice?

444
00:30:55.600 --> 00:30:57.123
Don't get dead.

445
00:30:57.320 --> 00:31:00.162
And you're back to being
an asshole. That's nice.

446
00:31:30.440 --> 00:31:32.600
Was not expecting Thunderdome.

447
00:31:36.320 --> 00:31:38.400
He's big. but he's slow.

448
00:31:39.600 --> 00:31:42.726
These are your weapons. Choose wisely.

449
00:31:47.600 --> 00:31:49.362
Good luck.

450
00:32:12.720 --> 00:32:14.880
Enough!

451
00:32:18.360 --> 00:32:19.485
To the death.

452
00:32:28.800 --> 00:32:31.482
What are they feeding you down here?

453
00:33:03.080 --> 00:33:05.558
She's probably in there having tea.

454
00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:14.330
Please don't be rats.

455
00:33:14.520 --> 00:33:17.043
Please don't be rats. Please don't be rats.

456
00:33:34.360 --> 00:33:35.360
Gross.

457
00:34:11.320 --> 00:34:13.082
Hello.

458
00:34:15.760 --> 00:34:17.840
- Hi.
- Would you like some tea?

459
00:34:19.480 --> 00:34:22.481
- What just happened?
- l thought we could use some privacy.

460
00:34:24.320 --> 00:34:27.048
Please. sit down.

461
00:34:32.880 --> 00:34:35.199
We don't have much time.

462
00:34:36.080 --> 00:34:39.240
- l want to help you.
- How?

463
00:34:39.440 --> 00:34:42.088
l'm a Pain Eater.

464
00:34:42.280 --> 00:34:44.678
Let me take yours.

465
00:34:45.560 --> 00:34:49.277
l can end your suffering if you'll trust me.

466
00:35:08.040 --> 00:35:10.040
Hello?

467
00:35:12.920 --> 00:35:14.523
Okay.

468
00:35:47.560 --> 00:35:49.242
l'd like to show you something.

469
00:35:55.560 --> 00:35:57.208
Those are your dead.

470
00:35:58.360 --> 00:36:01.247
l don't wanna be here anymore.
l don't wanna see this.

471
00:36:01.440 --> 00:36:04.645
That's all you've been doing.
10 long years.

472
00:36:04.840 --> 00:36:06.249
Killing and running.

473
00:36:06.640 --> 00:36:09.402
Killing and running.

474
00:36:09.920 --> 00:36:11.000
Aren't you tired?

475
00:36:12.240 --> 00:36:13.240
Yes.

476
00:36:13.440 --> 00:36:16.600
How many more will have
to die so you can live?

477
00:36:16.800 --> 00:36:21.403
No. No. it's not like that anymore.
l know what l really am.

478
00:36:21.600 --> 00:36:23.964
They told me that l can
learn how to fight it.

479
00:36:24.160 --> 00:36:27.524
You don't actually believe that. do you?

480
00:36:28.120 --> 00:36:30.280
You're an abomination. child.

481
00:36:31.480 --> 00:36:33.924
You know it in your heart.

482
00:36:34.960 --> 00:36:36.642
Do the right thing.

483
00:36:50.760 --> 00:36:52.760
Oh. Bo.

484
00:36:56.120 --> 00:36:59.359
But l don't know what the
right thing is anymore.

485
00:36:59.880 --> 00:37:01.880
Can you help me?

486
00:37:02.280 --> 00:37:04.280
lf you're willing.

487
00:37:05.680 --> 00:37:07.010
What is it?

488
00:37:07.200 --> 00:37:09.519
Your way out.

489
00:37:10.600 --> 00:37:13.601
You'll sleep and never wake up.

490
00:37:16.600 --> 00:37:19.919
- l don't know.
- lt will be quick and beautiful.

491
00:37:21.200 --> 00:37:23.723
A gesture of love.

492
00:37:23.920 --> 00:37:26.000
No one will even miss you.

493
00:37:26.560 --> 00:37:28.129
No one will mourn you.

494
00:37:28.600 --> 00:37:30.328
Nobody needs you.

495
00:37:30.520 --> 00:37:32.009
Bo. wake up!

496
00:37:32.760 --> 00:37:34.169
Bo. wake up. damn it!

497
00:37:34.360 --> 00:37:37.042
Bo. wake up. wake up.

498
00:37:37.240 --> 00:37:39.047
Bo. he's killing you! Wake up!

499
00:37:41.120 --> 00:37:42.529
- Drink.
- Bo!

500
00:37:42.720 --> 00:37:44.209
- Drink!
- Bo!

501
00:37:44.400 --> 00:37:47.287
Bo! Let me go. you big lughead!

502
00:37:48.000 --> 00:37:49.239
Bo!

503
00:37:49.440 --> 00:37:51.202
- Bo. wake up!
- Drink.

504
00:37:52.200 --> 00:37:53.564
No. No.

505
00:37:55.040 --> 00:37:57.086
Get out of my head. you freak.

506
00:38:01.280 --> 00:38:03.087
Help!

507
00:38:05.120 --> 00:38:07.120
She's mine.

508
00:38:09.880 --> 00:38:13.085
This one has passed the test.

509
00:38:13.960 --> 00:38:16.608
lt has been witnessed.

510
00:38:16.800 --> 00:38:20.437
Child. you may name your side.

511
00:38:21.080 --> 00:38:23.046
Neither.

512
00:38:23.800 --> 00:38:25.880
l choose humans.

513
00:38:47.120 --> 00:38:49.041
Now can we kill her?

514
00:38:49.840 --> 00:38:52.761
She passes without any training.

515
00:38:52.960 --> 00:38:54.529
Who is this girl?

516
00:38:54.720 --> 00:38:57.118
May l offer an opinion?

517
00:38:57.320 --> 00:38:59.968
You have no station here. old man.

518
00:39:00.160 --> 00:39:03.286
Don't you have some shoes to
cobble or a garden to decorate?

519
00:39:07.280 --> 00:39:11.042
Someone hid her from both our sides.

520
00:39:11.240 --> 00:39:15.605
lt would be wise to learn why
and who before killing her.

521
00:39:15.800 --> 00:39:17.846
ln the meantime. she could expose us.

522
00:39:18.040 --> 00:39:20.006
Not without exposing herself.

523
00:39:20.200 --> 00:39:24.565
l'm not saying there won't be a
time when she needs to be put down.

524
00:39:24.760 --> 00:39:27.806
l'm saying. choose it wisely.

525
00:39:54.000 --> 00:39:56.887
- Feel like we've been paroled.
- You sort of have been.

526
00:39:58.120 --> 00:40:00.689
Any conditions on our release?

527
00:40:01.120 --> 00:40:03.041
No more evidence for humans to find...

528
00:40:03.240 --> 00:40:06.718
no messing in Fae business.
and no more leaving town.

529
00:40:08.160 --> 00:40:10.967
The elders want you where
they can watch you.

530
00:40:11.160 --> 00:40:14.604
Well. they don't own me.
And l'm not very good at being obedient.

531
00:40:15.240 --> 00:40:16.649
Learn.

532
00:40:16.880 --> 00:40:19.244
- When you need help- -
- lf l need help.

533
00:40:19.840 --> 00:40:21.329
When you need help...

534
00:40:21.520 --> 00:40:24.725
you can find me at the 39th Division.

535
00:40:26.600 --> 00:40:28.282
And. Bo...

536
00:40:29.320 --> 00:40:31.082
you did well.

537
00:40:33.240 --> 00:40:35.922
l knew l smelled po-po.

538
00:40:44.760 --> 00:40:47.681
l'm not crazy.
right? That all just happened?

539
00:40:48.160 --> 00:40:49.763
Yep.

540
00:40:50.520 --> 00:40:52.964
And now we know anyone could be Fae.

541
00:40:53.160 --> 00:40:55.638
My bet's on wiener dude.

542
00:40:55.840 --> 00:40:58.920
So. what now?

543
00:40:59.120 --> 00:41:02.405
We go home. and we figure
out the rest tomorrow.

544
00:41:02.600 --> 00:41:03.964
''We.'' huh?

545
00:41:06.520 --> 00:41:08.839
l gotta figure out some
way to make a living.

546
00:41:09.040 --> 00:41:12.927
And you're the one who thought we'd
be a good team. So. yeah. ''we.''

547
00:41:13.120 --> 00:41:14.404
Cool.

548
00:41:14.600 --> 00:41:16.885
Just so we're clear about
this partnership...

549
00:41:17.080 --> 00:41:21.399
you be you and all. uh.
but l'm only into guys. Sorry.

550
00:41:21.600 --> 00:41:24.646
l'll try to contain
my disappointment.

551
00:41:25.305 --> 00:42:25.161
